      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This paraliturgical translation of Psalms 23 by Reb Zalman can be found in print as published in his <tei:hi rend="italic">All Breathing Life: At the Interface Between Poetry and Prayer: translations and compositions of Jewish sacred literature</tei:hi> (ed. Michael Kagan, 2011: Gaon Books), pp.191-192. The version there appears to be missing a translation of the final verse, Psalms 23:6. Thanks to Shir Meira (in the comments) for locating the missing translation, as published in <tei:hi rend="italic">Psalms in a translation for praying</tei:hi> (2014).</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
